; Sprites: hatted bird, left and right (8 frames)
;
; Eight 16x16 sprites of 32 bytes, 16 pixel rows of 2 bytes each (left byte, right byte; bit 7 = leftmost pixel). Sprite
; F of the page is at $BD00+32*F. Entity definitions (#R$A000) name the page in byte +5 and pick F from the animation
; phase, the direction and the slot data. The sprites are drawn with #R$9456 (#R$91BE) and have no colour of their own:
; ink and bright come from the entity definition. An upright bird-like figure with a hat and a beak, walking. Frames 0-3
; are used while moving left, 4-7 while moving right (bit 7 of entity byte +0). Used by entity definitions $36 $38 in
; rooms $19 (The Cold Store).
@label=SpritesHatBirds
